    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'You are at the playground with your child. Take a moment to look around
    and see how he is playing.


    Find your child at the yellow slide. Notice
    the birthday party, its speakers and balloons, and the aunty on the bench.


    Point
    with your RIGHT controller and release the trigger to select.'
